### Nomos Admin Queries - Verify the graph
### Run these AFTER 01-setup.http

### ============================================================
### Admin Queries
### ============================================================

### Get all audiences for auth0
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/audiences/auth0

### Get all audiences for keycloak
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/audiences/keycloak

### Get audiences for mobile-app-br (should show both auth0 and keycloak)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/app/mobile-app-br/audiences

### Get audiences for internal-backoffice
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/app/internal-backoffice/audiences

### Get apps by audience + issuer
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/apps?aud=mobile-br-auth0-client&iss=https%3A%2F%2Fauth0.example.com

### Get proxies accessible by mobile-app-br with auth0 audience
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/access/mobile-app-br?aud=mobile-br-auth0-client

### Get proxies accessible by mobile-app-br with keycloak audience (should be fewer)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/access/mobile-app-br?aud=mobile-br-kc-internal

### Get apps that can access account-service
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/proxy/account-service/apps

### ============================================================
### Runtime Rule Resolution (what the caller middleware uses)
### ============================================================

### SUCCESS: mobile-app-br via auth0 → account-service (should return rules)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules?proxy=account-service&aud=mobile-br-auth0-client&iss=https%3A%2F%2Fauth0.example.com&method=GET

### SUCCESS: mobile-app-br via keycloak → account-service (different jsonPaths)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules?proxy=account-service&aud=mobile-br-kc-internal&iss=https%3A%2F%2Fkeycloak.internal.com%2Frealms%2Fmain&method=GET

### SUCCESS: billing-service has no rules → returns defaultPolicy: "allow", rules: []
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules?proxy=billing-service&aud=mobile-br-auth0-client&iss=https%3A%2F%2Fauth0.example.com&method=GET

### ============================================================
### Error Cases
### ============================================================

### ERROR: Unknown audience (not registered)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules?proxy=account-service&aud=unknown-audience-xyz&iss=https%3A%2F%2Fauth0.example.com&method=GET

### ERROR: Audience exists but can't reach notification-service
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules?proxy=notification-service&aud=mobile-br-auth0-client&iss=https%3A%2F%2Fauth0.example.com&method=GET

### ERROR: Wrong issuer for this audience
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules?proxy=account-service&aud=mobile-br-auth0-client&iss=https%3A%2F%2Fwrong-issuer.com&method=GET
